msgstr "Haddii daahitaanka wareegga-buuxa ee mid ka mid ah hababka ping ee Cacti ee horay loo qeexay uu ka bato xadkan, diiwaangeli Digniin ama dir Iimayl iyadoo lagu salaynayo Muhiimadda Aaladaha iyo dejinta Kormeerka. Halbeeggu waa milliseken. U dejinta 0 way joojisaa. Thold Plugin ayaa loo baahan yahay si looga faa'iidaysto shaqadan."

